                                CUSTOM MENU

        The file, CUSTOM.MNU is an example of how a customized version
of TLXZMENU would work.  The example has only a few options on each of 
the additional menus.  When you order your customized version, you will 
supply the option names and their text output on the enclosed 
CUSTOM.FRM.  To help you choose menu colors, run COLOR.MNU and view the 
colors available.  You may only choose color numbers in the range 1 to 
128.  Numbers greater than 128 give blinking text.

        Please print the CUSTOM.FRM and fill in the areas for the 
options that you would like on your personal menus.  If you do not have 
a printer, please supply the information on paper.

        The MACROS menu will send the macro keys that you have 
configured in your TELIX 3.12.  The mouse menu will send only the 
actual macro's keypress, and NOT text like you see in the sample.  You 
supply the titles for each of your macro selections.

        The BBS MENU will send text strings of the common BBS commands 
that you use.  This mouse menu can save you some of your TELIX macro 
keys.  The example shows a username selection that could be used for 
signing onto a board, or for filing a new user application.

        When you order your customized menu, be sure to include the 
CUSTOM.FRM.  Send $15.00 to:

